# DarkTrooper (REL 12), Temple Grounds 05_temple_federationsite layer 9 (dct3, fn_12_5A48).
# The only two shipped placements with flotsam=1 AND scannableInfoWhenAttacking = kInvalidAssetId
# (editor ids 0x242b0242 / 0x242b0259, tools/scan_darktrooper_loader.py), i.e. the ctor's E4true
# and E3false arms. Only construction matters here, so this activates the layer and reports the
# objects; the damage steps keep the two from just standing there.
# Run: tools/cov/force.sh tools/cov/specs/darktrooper_dct3.py <out> 3bfa3eff,05_temple_federationsite \
#        --con tools/drivers/darktrooper_federationsite.con --fast --frames 1800 --env MP2_GODMODE=1
@f300 god 1
@f302 layer 9
@f600 obj u0242; obj u0259
@f900 objs DarkTrooper
@f1200 damage u0242 999; damage u0259 999
@f1500 objs DarkTrooper
